  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueTrigger
  lines:
  - Hurry detective!!!!
  - 'Frank has been found dead '
  - Quickly find the code on the TV to open the safe at the corner of the bedroom.
    USE E to enter code.What if they took his gun!!!!!!
  - Another thing Frank lived alone so there should be one fingerprint in this house.
  - 'PRESS F to use the scanner. Check the bathroom and the living room for fingerprints '
  - 'IF THERE IS NO GUN IN THE SAFE AND TWO FINGERPRINTS IN THE HOUSE '
  - WE HAVE A PROBLEM DETECTIVE
  - USE THE GREY DOOR TO GO TO THE OFFICE TO INVESTIGATE
  dialoguePanel: {fileID: 490854173}
  dialogueTextComponent: {fileID: 536355946}
